    "abilities": [
      {
        "name": "Cult Demagogue",
        "description": "While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, you can re-roll the Hit roll."
      },
      {
        "name": "Leader",
        "description": "This model can be attached to the following units:\n- **^^Acolyte Hybrids with Hand Flamers^^**\n- **^^Acolyte Hybrids with Autopistols^^**\n- **^^Hybrid Metamorphs^^**\n- **^^Neophyte Hybrids^^**"
      },
      {
        "name": "Dirtcycle",
        "description": "Change this model's Move characteristic to 12\", its Toughness characteristic to 4, remove the **^^Infantry^^** keyword, and add the **^^Mounted^^** keyword. Remove the Deep Strike and Infiltrators abilities (if applicable), it gains the Scouts 9\" and Stealth abilities, and replace the list of units this model can be attached to: **^^Atalan Jackals^^**."
      },
      {
        "name": "Shepherd of the Blessed",
        "description": "Replace the list of units this model can be attached to: **^^Aberrants^^**."
      },
      {
        "name": "Voice of New Truths",
        "description": "In your Command phase, one model from your army with this ability can use it. If it does, select one enemy unit within 18\" of it; that enemy unit must take a Battle-shock test."
      },
      {
        "name": "Blessed Venom",
        "description": "Melee weapons equipped by models in this unit have the **[ANTI-INFANTRY 3+]** ability"
      },
      {
        "name": "Elusive",
        "description": "Once per turn, when an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move within 9\" of this model, if this model is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can make a Normal move of up to 6\"."
      },
      {
        "name": "Insidious Evasion",
        "description": "At the end of your opponent's Fight phase, if this unit is not within Engagement Range of any enemy units, once per battle, you may remove this unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves."
      },
      {
        "name": "Psychic Spoor",
        "description": "At the start of the first battle round, select one enemy unit to be this model's prey. Each time this model makes an attack that targets it prey, you can re-roll the Hit roll and you can re-roll the Wound roll."
      },
      {
        "name": "Shadow Killer",
        "description": "If this model is no part of an Attached unit and if this model is equipped with no ranged weapons (excluding pistols), enemy units cannot use the Fire Overwatch Stratagem to shoot at this model."
      },
      {
        "name": "Spiritual Leader",
        "description": "Once per battle, at the start of any phase, you can select one friendly **^^Genestealer Cults^^** unit that is Battle-shocked and within 12\" of this model. That unit is no longer Battle-shocked."
      },
      {
        "name": "Twisted Science",
        "description": "While this model is leading a unit, melee weapons equipped by models in that unit have the **[LETHAL HITS]** ability."
      }
    ],
