      {
        "name": "Leader",
        "description": "This model can be attached to the following units: ^^**Electro-Priests, Kataphrons, Skitarii Rangers, Skitarii Vanguard**^^"
      },
      {
        "name": "Technoarcane Zealotry",
        "description": "While this model's unit is in range of one or more objective markers, improve this model's Leadership characteristic by 1."
      },
      {
        "name": "Leader",
        "description": "This model can be attached to the following units: ^^**Serberys Raiders, Serberys Sulphurhounds**^^"
      },
      {
        "name": "Leader",
        "description": "This model can be attached to the following units: ^^**Kastelan Robots**^^\n\n\nYou can attach this model to a ^^**Kastelan Robots**^^ unit, even if one or more ^^**Cybernetica Datasmith**^^ models have been attached to it. In such cases, if that Bodyguard unit is destroyed, the Leader units attached to it become separate units with their original Starting Strengths. While attached to a ^^**Kastelan Robots**^^ unit, this model loses the ^^**Infantry**^^ keyword and models in that unit have the Doctrina Imperatives Faction ability."
      },
      {
        "name": "Leader",
        "description": "This model can be attached to the following units: ^^**Pteraxii Skystalkers, Pteraxii Sterylizors**^^"
      },
      {
        "name": "Leader",
        "description": "This model can be attached to the following units: ^^**Sicarian Infiltrators, Sicarian Ruststalkers**^^"
      },
      {
        "name": "Control Edict",
        "description": "While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, you can re-roll the Hit roll."
      },
      {
        "name": "Galvanic Field",
        "description": "While this model is leading a unit, weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [^^Lethal Hits^^] ability."
      },
      {
        "name": "Omnissiah's Blessing",
        "description": "In your Command phase, select one friendly ^^**Adeptus Mechanicus**^^ model within 3\" of this model. That model regains up to D3 lost wounds and, if it is a ^^**Vehicle**^^ model, until the start of your next Command phase, that model has the Feel No Pain 5+ ability. Each model can only be selected for this ability once per Command phase."
      },
      {
        "name": "Seekers of Divine Arcana",
        "description": "While this model is leading a unit, add 1 to the Objective Control characteristic of models in that unit."
      }
