        "description": "This model can be attached to the following units: \n\n\n■  Assault Intercessor Squad \n■  Bladeguard Veteran Squad \n■  Company Heroes \n■  Hellblaster Squad \n■  Infernus Squad \n■  Intercessor Squad \n■  Sternguard Veteran Squad \n■  Wardens of Ultramar"
