    "abilities": [
      {
        "name": "More Lads, More Swagger",
        "description": "Improve this model's Leadership characteristic by 1 for every 5 models in this unit."
      },
      {
        "name": "Leader",
        "description": "This model can be attached to the following units:\n- **^^Boyz^^**\n- **^^Nobz^^**"
      },
      {
        "name": "Rokkit Pack",
        "description": "**^^Hordeboss^^** only. Change this model's Move characteristic to 12\", add the **^^Jump Pack^^** and **^^Fly^^** keywords, and it gains the Deep Strike ability. Replace the list of units this model can be attached to: **^^Stormboyz^^**"
      },
      {
        "name": "Warbike",
        "description": "**^^Hordeboss^^** or **^^Warphead^^** only. Change this model's Move characteristic to 12\", its Toughness and Wounds characteristic to 6, its Save characteristic to 4+, and it is equipped with 1 twin dakkagun in addition to the weapons you choose in Step 4. Remove the **^^Infantry^^** keyword, add the **^^Mounted^^**keyword, and replace the list of units this model can be attached to: **^^Warbikers^^**."
      },
      {
        "name": "Top-tier Gubbinz",
        "description": "**^^Hordeboss^^** only. Add the **^^Mek^^** keyword. Replace the list of units this model can be attached to: **^^Burna Boyz^^**, **^^Flash Gitz^^**, **^^Kommandos^^**, **^^Lootaz^^**, **^^Mek Gunz^^**, **^^Tankbustas^^**."
      },
      {
        "name": "Smasha Squig",
        "description": "**^^Hordeboss^^** or **^^Warphead^^** only. Change this model's Move characteristic to 10\", its Toughness characteristic  to 7, its Save characteristic to 4+, its Wounds characteristic to 6, and it is equipped with 1 squig jaws in addition to the weapons you choose in Step 4. Remove the **^^Infantry^^** keyword, add the **^^Mounted^^** and **^^Beast Snagga^^** keywords, and replace the list of units this model can be attached to: **^^Squighog Boyz^^**."
      },
      {
        "name": "Thunderous Dakkastorm",
        "description": "In your Shooting phase, after this model has shot, select on enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks; that unit must take a Battle-shock test."
      },
      {
        "name": "Dok's Toolz",
        "description": "**^^Hordeboss^^** or **^^Upstart Gretchin^^** only. While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability."
      },
      {
        "name": "Kustom Force Field",
        "description": "**^^Hordeboss^^** only. While the bearer is leading a unit, models in that unit have a 4+ invulnerable save against ranged attacks."
      },
      {
        "name": "Malicious Opportunist",
        "description": "**^^Upstart Gretchin^^** only. While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll and add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
      {
        "name": "Might is Right",
        "description": "**^^Hordeboss^^** only. While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to the Hit roll."
      },
      {
        "name": "Roar of Mork (Psychic)",
        "description": "**^^Warphead^^** only. In your opponent's Command phase, you can select one enemy unit within 18\" of and visible to this Psyker and roll one D6: on a 1, this unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 2+, until the start of your opponent's next Command phase, that enemy unit is confrazzled. While a unit is confrazzled, each time a Battle-shock or Leadership test is taken for it, subtract 2 from that test."
      }
    ],
